Development checkpoint only; no blanket redistribution license is asserted.

Local Illingworth solver and numerical/mesh helper modules are copied from the
research fork; host services remain dependency-owned. The binary scheme
describes a port of MAP C++ code. Applicable permissions and
ownership of local extensions must be resolved before a public release. This file is a statement
of unresolved licensing status, not a new grant covering the fork.

The upstream kawin MIT notice is reproduced in NOTICE for attribution. It does
not by itself settle the rights to local additions or MAP-derived material.
